{
  "_about": "Word lists for engine/moderation.js. crisis, crisis_mention and threat are regular expressions; every other list is matched as whole words or phrases, case-insensitive. Slur and sexual lists block a post (sexual content that also mentions a minor is held and kept for reporting instead); everything else holds it for a person. Keep lists short: the daily moderation review (a person or Claude reading every new post) catches what lists miss. Add a term only with a test in test/moderation.test.js.",
